    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You crashland on an unknown planet and is unable to get back to your ship. Explore different environments, unlock new abilities, fight tough foes and find secrets in order to get back to your ship and return home</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay driven 2D platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world and find new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and simple 2D platformer with many of the abilities you have come to expect from a metroidvania.<br><br>(Trailer music:\u00a0AiRwolf by\u00a0Djjaner)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You crashland on an unknown planet and is unable to get back to your ship. Explore different environments, unlock new abilities, fight tough foes and find secrets in order to get back to your ship and return home</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay driven 2D platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world and find new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and simple 2D platformer with many of the abilities you have come to expect from a metroidvania.<br><br>(Trailer music:\u00a0AiRwolf by\u00a0Djjaner)</p>",
